    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><strong><span>大家好，这里是霓特发电站。本期是久违的趣闻回。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主播：大巴、日天</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>投稿邮箱：191558060@qq.com</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">1:15</a> 网红恶搞打工人，但结局美好。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo861M8s3xrxE71qn6ZNynEa9hyM.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">6:23</a> 巴西一家游戏店被同行寄炸弹。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMXcMF2Lp6zcdGnfrmzmSYwEbr9.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> BBC说英国一家个人经营的游戏店只卖出5份《GTA6》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4pesUJaLTQOrXQpaSP5kzDjvIx.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 法国议员提出一项修正案，让外国互联网公司给法国交“流量税”。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 日本青少年的“少林寺竞速”，试图复刻67？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 女厕所惊现《怪物猎人4G》，何意味？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8Vz1zDDy8XC3_pl-9Kti4ctH6U.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 玛俐人设画师发了点小感慨，但评论区吵得火热。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpEgD7htNZBE9OFGVWKOMlMiOYkK.png"><p></p>]]></description>
