    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><strong><span>大家好，这里是霓特发电站。本期节目与各位分享一下今年10月番的初见观后感。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主播：大巴、日天</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>投稿邮箱：191558060@qq.com</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">0:43</a> 《龙珠超 比鲁斯》，画面优化了不少。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9ils44BMlA-IqSL1S_HBzq3qVW.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 《僵尸搜寻中》，丧尸题材里的另类作品。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0HNl_rkdfV56B_44DKyqusVUfP.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 《新 网球王子 U-17世界杯决赛成员决定战》，作画岌岌可危。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKLbBXQQTDCurPx_rZWICP9E_qB.png"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 《FX战士久留美》，小姑娘尝试发大财。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flf7tediVSTVeWlnHXmLt8d0yXwA.webp"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 《被流放的超能附魔师 讴歌随心所欲的第二人生》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYpct0H_9g8MKJK1PZ7T6wHm198.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 《超巡 超条前辈》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUH5TY6fWKYoM97Ypvk1TZhgJta.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 《战车椅子》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvOsZzvyvaRtx_rKJcuZLXoqpETx.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> 《脑洞学生会》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuzoKJoH9_88IGmvcMtFGbOQlacL.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 《装备我最强》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTQVsQPC3dFbBOEd7VcwXDS8ruP.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 《兽王武神丹帝拜恩》，封面没有主角的叔叔，感觉之后会很危险。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjIaP3NPB2zFbb8QSQFzTNCu4Rsj.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
